   "en": "A thunder bird has started appearing out of nowhere and devouring people. Those devoured are brought back to life in a new body. Kase's old teacher, Suruga, was killed by the birds, so he takes in his daughter, Mari. However, a corpse matching Mari is soon found, and Mari is kidnapped. Kase is determined to find Mari and discover what is going on.\n___\n**Alt Official Raw:** [MagaPoke](https://pocket.shonenmagazine.com/episode/10834108156632006044)"
